/cat-art-cat-themed-gallery-room-with-sculpted-cat-letsuan-design.jpg", "caption": "麗荃室內裝修｜貓美術館——貓咪主題展廳，陳列貓咪雕塑與裱框畫作"}], "author": {"@id": "https://letsuan.com/#organization"}, "datePublished": "2024", "dateModified": "2026-09-18", "hasPart": [{"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "設計策略：以色塊分區作為敘事骨架"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "從平面到立體：裝置轉譯與場景重建"}, {"@type": "CreativeWork", "name": "光線與動線設計"}], "isPartOf": {"@id": "https://letsuan.com/#website"}, "location": {"@type": "Place", "name": "屏東，臺灣"}, "startDate": "2024", "citation": [{"@type": "NewsArticle", "name": "萌翻屏東！貓美術館限定場景超療癒", "url": "https://www.pthg.gov.tw/plantou/News_Content.aspx?n=3D7FE3A6F999D6C2&sms=6B402F30807E7BB3&s=F54C1BF5EDAFC5C1", "datePublished": "2024-01-25", "publisher": {"@type": "GovernmentOrganization", "name": "屏東縣政府"}}, {"@type": "NewsArticle", "name": "史上最萌「貓•美術館」2024年登台！５展區＋60件名畫一次看，預售票11/22開賣", "url": "https://supertaste.tvbs.com.tw/travel/346249", "datePublished": "2023-11-21", "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "TVBS食尚玩家"}}], "subjectOf": {"@type": "VideoObject", "name": "貓美術館 CAT ART 屏菸1936文化基地", "url": "https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=807356837868237", "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "屏菸1936文化基地"}}}, {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "首頁", "item": "https://letsuan.com/zh-TW/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "作品集", "item": "https://letsuan.com/zh-TW/portfolio"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "貓美術館", "item": "https://letsuan.com/zh-TW/project-cat-art"}]}];
